Z||000008||mrfiero||07-29-2001||02:31 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by new fiero:<BR><B>Hey, I live just east of the Springs. Been here since 97 and have seen multiple Fieros. See 2 others everyday on my way into work. Let me know about starting a club in the springs area....Im in!<P>Andy<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Hey Andy.......how's the project coming??  I was sure that tornado last month blew your Fieros away.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>LMK if you need anything else and remember......I still want whatever is left over.<P>As for the club.......as many people may know (well...maybe not) I tried a few times to get a club going, but nothing "stuck".  There are a few core guys around, but until we can spread out certain responsibiities another attempt will likely fail too (one guy can't do it all).<P>I am open to another attempt......maybe we could try organizing something for August.  I still have names and e-mail address, etc. so I could do a mass mailing to generate the interest.<P>DrRodey......maybe you, Wayne (wkayl) and myself can get together and set things up before we have an "official" meeting.  <P>E-mail me your thoughts and let's get this thing going!<P><BR>||||reg||1
