Z||000020||Rogue_Ant||07-30-2001||09:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LT1 Chop Top:<BR><B>Rouge,<P>I have considered moving to the Fountain/Ft. Carson area.  What do you think of it (housing values, schools, people, Fiero mechanics)??</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Lets see, Colorado Springs is one of the fastest growing cities in America so the housing can be a little pricy in town.  But there are places where it isn't too bad.  <BR>As for schools, I'm not to sure about colleges I know there are a few choices to include Pikes Peak Community College, Pheonix, UCCS, and prob a few others in surrounding areas.  <BR>The town is mostly import oriented - but there is a lot of different car clubs and performance shops.  <BR>As for mechanics, I'm not to familiar with many - I'm usually my mechanic.<BR>Otherwise its a fairly nice town, decent size around 100,000 people I think.<P>Rogue<P>P.S. oh yeah, its right by an Army post so a lot of stuff is oriented to us soldiers.<BR>||||reg||1
